LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
# LAMMPS输入文件示例：使用Martini 3粗粒化力场计算PDMS的均方回转半径
# -----------------------------------------------------
# 1. 初始化设置
# -----------------------------------------------------
units               real
dimension           3
boundary            p p p
atom_style          full

# 读取包含PDMS分子结构的data文件
read_data           pdms_2_box_test.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-5 -5.006 -5) to (134 133.997 133.999)
  2 by 4 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  12350 atoms
